Arborium's published archives omit the grammar and glue-code license texts.
These sections retain upstream notices and Arborium's MIT notice verbatim.
The Markdown inline parser also omits its notice. Package archive checksums,
notice sources and notice checksums are recorded in scripts/lib/grammar-sources.json.
The archive checksums must match Cargo.lock before a release is packaged.
Some Arborium grammars omit an upstream revision or refer to an unavailable
repository/revision; those cases are identified explicitly in the source records.
The Visual Basic source contains only author/license metadata, retained below.
Release packages carry these source records in license-index.json.


